```

а затем внутренние приватные элементы:

```swift
private let stackView = UIStackView()
private let topContainer = UIView()
private let trackerNameTextField = UITextField()
private let warningLabel =

PR review on RyderFreeman4Logos/mempal

Review comment:
![high](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/high-priority.svg)

The `initialize_from_config` method duplicates the exact initialization logic of `classifier()`. More importantly, because it directly calls `OnceCell::set` instead of coordinating via `OnceCell::get_or_try_init`, any concurrent call to `classifier()` (e.g., from an incoming request) while the background prewarm task is running will trigger a duplicate, expensive embedding compilation. Delegating to `self.classifier()` resolves the duplication and guarantees single-execution safety.

```rust
    pub async fn initialize_from_config(&self) -> Result<(), GatingInitError> {
        let _ = self.classifier().await?;
        Ok(())
    }
```

